  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen UN peace operations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to strengthen the UN&apos;s capacity to plan and manage peace operations, based i.a. on recent reports on reform of UN peace operations, incl. the report of the High-level Independent Panel (of June 2015), and the UN Secretary General&apos;s Action for Peacekeeping (A4P) + support to the implementation of the General Santor Cruz Report on Improving Security of Peacekeepers and its Plan of Action.</narrative>
  </description>
